y ran out","m":0,"ko":"돈이 다 떨어졌다","en":"I had no money left","note_ko":"run out: 다 써서 없어지다.","note_en":"\"Run out\" = be used up."},{"t":"if it's anyone's","m":1,"ko":"잘못이 있다면","en":"if anybody is to blame","note_ko":"책임을 스스로 지는 말투.","note_en":"Takes the blame on oneself."}]},"c3-l6":{"words":["bedroom","grand","style","imagination","wood","bed","chair","window"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"has to do everything","m":0,"ko":"모든 걸 해내야 한다","en":"must do all the work","note_ko":"have to: '~해야 한다'.","note_en":"\"Have to\" expresses necessity."},{"t":"In short","m":1,"ko":"요컨대","en":"to sum up","note_ko":"앞의 말을 짧게 정리할 때.","note_en":"Used to sum up what was said."}]},"c3-l7":{"words":["kitchen","cost","evening","earn","rough","row","moon","hat"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"earn it back","m":1,"ko":"그 돈을 다시 벌다","en":"make that money again","note_ko":"earn back: (쓴 돈을) 다시 벌어들이다.","note_en":"To get back money you spent by working."},{"t":"any day","m":2,"ko":"언제라도","en":"very soon, at any moment","note_ko":"곧 일어날 수 있다는 뜻.","note_en":"Very soon, on any day now."}]},"c4-l1":{"words":["telegram","strike","shape","confidence","produce","matt","flesh","courage"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"in good health","m":0,"ko":"건강하게","en":"healthy","note_ko":"안부를 전할 때 자주 쓰는 말.","note_en":"A common phrase in news about someone."},{"t":"I can't help it","m":2,"ko":"나도 어쩔 수가 없어","en":"I can't change it","note_ko":"can't help it: 어쩔 수 없다.","note_en":"\"I can't help it\" = it is not in my control."}]},"c4-l2":{"words":["become","comfortable","artist","spend","dare","remain","post","useful"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"not only comfortable but","m":0,"ko":"편안할 뿐 아니라","en":"comfortable and also more","note_ko":"not only A but (also) B.","note_en":"Adds a stronger second point."},{"t":"to finish","m":2,"ko":"끝으로","en":"to end this letter","note_ko":"편지·연설을 맺을 때.","note_en":"Used when closing a letter or speech."}]},"c4-l3":{"words":["fall","leaf","apartment","carpet","wine","distance","setting","alo